    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Reprinted with permission from: Eble JN, Sauter G, Epstein JI, Sesterhenn IA (2004). World Health Organiztion Classification of Tumours. Pathology and Genetics of the Urinary System and Male Genital Organs. 3rd edition. Lyon: IARCPress. and Moch H, Humphrey PA, Ulbright TM, Reuter VE (eds): WHO Classification of Tumours of the Urinary System and Male Genital Organs (4th edition). IARC: Lyon 2016.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; \" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 135.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"181\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">Perilobar rests</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">Intralobar rests</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.5pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">Position in lobe</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 135.8pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"181\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Peripheral</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.35pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Random</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.5pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">Margins</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 135.8pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"181\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Sharp, demarcated</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.35pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Irregular, intermingling</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" height: 28.1pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.5pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" \">Composition</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 135.8pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"181\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Blastema, tubules</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Stroma scant or sclerotic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.35pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 28.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Stroma, blastema, tubules</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" \">Stroma often predominates</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\" color: black; \">Distribution</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 135.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"181\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Usually multifocal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 144.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"192\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\" color: black; \">Often unifocal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
